Package: langgraphr
Type: Package
Title: Agentic AI for R, Powered by LangGraph
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("langgraphr", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dev@example.org")
Description: Build agentic applications in pure R on top of the LangGraph
    engine, which runs invisibly as a local background server. Includes a
    full graph-authoring DSL whose node functions are plain R, a quick
    assistant path whose tools are plain R functions, thread-based memory,
    automatic VPN/proxy-resilient networking and a hidden server manager.
    No Python code is ever written by the user.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    R6 (>= 2.5.1),
    cli (>= 3.6.0),
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.8),
    processx (>= 3.8.2)
Suggests:
    dotenv,
    duckdb (>= 1.0.0),
    httpuv (>= 1.6.9),
    shiny (>= 1.8.0),
    bslib (>= 0.7.0),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
